      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/nook.jpg",
        "image_mask": "portrait",
        "image2_mask": "square",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "The Farmstand Nook",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Lettuce Grow CEO, Jacob Pechenik, said it best...</p><ul><li><h4><em>It’s the magic. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>It’s sharing the feeling of growing your own food, of being a farmer.</em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of creating and observing life. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of enjoying the bees and the butterflies. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of watching kids sneak off, stealing fresh produce off of the Farmstand, and popping it into their mouths between giggles.</em></h4></li></ul><p>Grow herbs, greens, flowers and more, all year long, with the Farmstand Nook: a compact, 20-plant indoor edition of our self-watering and self-fertilizing hydroponic system.</p><p>The Nook is designed to make it easy to grow produce indoors, even in tight spaces. With a smaller tank and fully-integrated lights, the Farmstand Nook empowers any home chef to grow the freshest ingredients just steps from their stove top. Prepare for the ultimate dinner table transformation.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
