        "96a58abe-15e9-41be-a763-825ae0982e23": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I assemble my Farmstand Nook?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLh0cc4oAus\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLh0cc4oAus\">Here is a complete guide to assembling your Farmstand Nook. </a>We can't wait to get growing with you!</p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "65fffa90-a1ec-4dad-a554-341bb16963cf": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I reset my Farmstand Nook?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Maintain healthy plant growth by resetting your Farmstand Nook every two months. Remove all of your plants and gently clean each component. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vUHBqaPNs0w\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vUHBqaPNs0w\">Follow along with our video guide here for detailed instructions.</a></p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "59261c80-e8c7-47c3-a3f2-ff02cf967f67": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What are the recommended watering cycles?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p> </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Mechanical_Water__Irrigation_Cycle_Chart_070623.jpg",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "71949193-2fe9-4957-8c4d-795f5bf9560b": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I do weekly maintenance?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Just a few minutes of maintenance each week will help your seedlings thrive. We filmed a little video to help you through the process, from adding nutrients to testing and adjusting pH levels.<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mYUHU3aYvFA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mYUHU3aYvFA\"> Watch the video for more information!</a></p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
